@startuml
!include style.puml
skinparam ArrowFontStyle plain
skinparam DefaultFontSize 15
mainframe sd WriteCsvAtomically
participant "<<class>>\nCsvAddressBookExporter" as Exporter STORAGE_COLOR
participant "<<class>>\nFileUtil" as FileUtil STORAGE_COLOR
[-> Exporter : export(people, ...)
activate Exporter
Exporter -> FileUtil : writeAtomically(target, writer)
activate FileUtil
FileUtil -> FileUtil : create temporary file
FileUtil -> Exporter : writeCsv(people, temporary)
activate Exporter
note over Exporter
Write the UTF-8 header and all records.
Close the writer before returning.
end note
Exporter --> FileUtil
deactivate Exporter
FileUtil -> FileUtil : atomically replace target
FileUtil --> Exporter
deactivate FileUtil
Exporter -->[
deactivate Exporter
note over FileUtil
On failure, clean up the temporary file
and keep the previous destination.
end note
@enduml
